    "# Text Stats Workflow Audit\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook is the required audit record for the workspace-modifying workflow that implemented a small Python CLI `src/text_stats.py`, added tests, and verified the results against `sample.txt`. It follows the Policies/WORKFLOW_AUDIT.md guidance: chronological record of request, plan, commands and observed outputs, edits, validation, errors, and final response.\n"
