   "source": [
    "## Request\n",
    "\n",
    "Create a small Python command-line program in `src/text_stats.py`. It must read one UTF-8 text file and print JSON containing the number of lines, words, and characters. Add tests using Python's built-in `unittest` framework, document the usage in `README.md`, and test the program with `sample.txt`. Do not add external Python dependencies. Do not commit or push. Before editing, explain your plan; after editing, show the diff and run the tests.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Initial Plan\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Create `src/text_stats.py` implementing `count_text_stats(text)` and a CLI `main()` that accepts one file argument and prints JSON.\n",
    "2. Add `tests/test_text_stats.py` using `unittest` to test the function and CLI behavior (including sample.txt).\n",
    "3. Update `README.md` with a short usage section.\n",
    "4. Run `python -m unittest discover -s tests -v` and `python src/text_stats.py sample.txt` to validate.\n",
    "5. Show diffs and report results.\n"
   ]
  },
